Z||000003||Eddie.H||01-24-2000||05:08 PM||||Theogre that gasket does hold the washer inplace I whent back to napa and told the guy Theogre said  that the gasket will not hold the wash inplace  he said who is Theorge tell him the washer is steel in the middle and it will hold the washer and he gave me a new gasket for the napa EGR VALVE.||||reg||12
Z||000005||Patrick||01-24-2000||05:43 PM||||<BR><B>Eddie</B>, are you going to listen to a guy who works behind a parts counter, or are you going to listen to someone like Ogre who actually works on cars?<P>I changed the EGR valve on my 2.5L, so I know exactly what Ogre is talking about. I suggest you follow his advice on this one. It can't hurt and it may save you a lot of grief.<BR>||||reg||5
